This example's directory structure follows the publicly documented Flux
multi-tenancy layout:

  fluxcd/flux2-multi-tenancy
  https://github.com/fluxcd/flux2-multi-tenancy
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (a per-team folder with its own namespace, ServiceAccount, RoleBinding,
  GitRepository and Kustomization applied with the tenant's own
  serviceAccountName, bootstrapped by a platform-owned layer that runs with
  no impersonation)

No file content from that repository is copied here. Every file in this
directory was written for this example. The application content (the
storefront, payments-api and loyalty-api Deployments and Services) is
original to this example, under this repository's own MIT license (see the
top-level LICENSE file).
